Package: patrone-installer
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, sudo, gnome-kiosk, gnome-session-bin
Description: PatroneOS's installer, for its live session
 Ubuntu's installer front end (ubuntu-desktop-provision's ubuntu_bootstrap),
 built from the commit the ISO's installer snap was built from, with PatroneOS
  as its name. It works with the ubuntu-desktop-bootstrap snap's install
 engine, and Patrone's ISO starts it in place of the snap's own front end.
 patrone-branding gives it Patrone's colors, pictures and slides.
